      "remarks": "The obligation set that applies to a deployer of an AI system classified as high-risk under Article 6(2) (Annex III) from 2 December 2027, as deferred by Regulation (EU) 2026/1744 from 2 August 2026. Articles 13 and 14 are included because the deployer's duties under Article 26 are discharged against the information and oversight affordances the provider is required to supply: a deployer cannot assess Article 26(1) without the Article 13 instructions for use. Article 27 applies only to the deployer categories it enumerates; where it does not apply, record that determination rather than omitting the control. Article 25 is included because a deployer that puts its name on a system, substantially modifies it, or changes its intended purpose becomes a provider."
    },
